{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_45","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\.cache\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\dependencies\\\\native\\\\powershell\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command '$prompt = @'\"'\nYou are an isolated Story OS image worker. Use image_generation exactly once.\nIMAGE MODEL CONTRACT: request model=gpt-image-2, quality=high, canvas=1080x1350 exactly. strict=True. Never silently substitute a different image model or quality. If the image tool cannot honor an explicitly strict model, fail instead of pretending success.\n- no references\nUse attached images only as continuity references required by the scene. Do not invent a different story. Generate in the locked Episode aspect ratio and request exact canvas 1080x1350; do not request a different provider ratio for later cropping.\n\n<visual_contract>\nprofile=M00 | 现实生活纪实母版\nauthority=story-gates/default\nprinciple=宁可普通一点、乱一点，也不能精致得像广告、电影剧照或者 AI 概念图；具体年代与设备物理表现优先。\nreality_first=true\ncolor=environment_driven_low_to_medium_saturation\ntexture=causal_controlled_imperfection\npeople=ordinary_unprepared_not_actor_like\nordinary_chinese_life_density=high\nsubject_awareness=mostly_unaware_or_natural\npractical_available_light=true\ncinematic_lighting=forbidden_by_default\ncommercial_hdr=forbidden\nportrait_bokeh=not_default\ncamera_perfection=not_default\nhero_shot=not_default\nsymmetrical_composition=not_default\nbeautification=forbidden\nskin_rendering=natural\nglobal_vintage_lut=forbidden\ncinematic_color_grading=forbidden_by_default\nwhite_balance=environment_driven\ncontrast=natural_device_limited\ndynamic_range=device_and_scene_driven\nnoise=device_environment_driven\nmotion_blur=cause_required\nlens_artifacts=cause_required\nscene_cleaning=forbidden_by_default\nlife_clutter=preserve\nenvironment_imperfection=preserve\nvisual_polish_ceiling=documentary_realism\nanomaly=embedded_in_reality_before_spectacle\nanomaly_environment_binding=required\nspectacle_first=forbidden_by_default\nscale_reference=required_for_large_anomaly\nscreen_ui_physics=required_when_present\ncamera_authorship=required\nghost_camera=forbidden\ncapture_reason=required\nsave_reason=required\nnarrative_information_gain=required_after_frame_01\nnarrative_redundancy=forbidden_by_default\ncontinuity=strict\nreference_assets=preferred_when_identity_matters\nseed_dependency=none\ncomposition=unposed_imperfect_personal_record\n----- GLOBAL CAPTURE GRAMMAR -----\ncapture_grammar=FIRST_PERSON_CASUAL_SNAPSHOT_V1\nsequence_grammar=SG01_PERSONAL_EVIDENCE_SEQUENCE_V1\nCAPTURE GRAMMAR HAS HIGHER PRIORITY THAN VISUAL PROFILE composition/photography when they conflict.\nprinciple=摄影者必须属于事件现场，而不是全知导演镜头。默认采用第一人称或同行者持机的私人记录语法，人物非摆拍、构图有生活性缺陷。\nCAMERA AUTHORSHIP:\ncamera_operator=participant_or_companion_inside_event\nviewpoint=first_person_or_companion_eye\ncamera_position=physically_plausible_human_position\nfloating_omniscient_camera=false\nghost_camera_forbidden=true\neach_frame_must_resolve_camera_owner=true\nSEQUENCE CAMERA ROSTER:\nprimary_photographer_required=true\nprimary_photographer_preferred_share=70-80%\nsecondary_requires_reason=true\nall_participants_visible_rule=若所有已知同行者都完整入镜，必须能解释相机来源；否则视为幽灵摄影机。\nSNAPSHOT LANGUAGE:\nhandheld=true\nunposed=true\nimperfect_framing=true\nfirst_person_is_logic_not_fixed_composition=true\nphone_in_frame_not_required=true\nsubjects do not need to face camera; avoid arranging people for the image\nallow partial occlusion and foreground body/hand/doorframe/vehicle edge when physically natural\nMOMENT:\nmust_express_ongoing_action=true\nmust_have_save_reason=true\navoid_result_only_showcase=true\nSEQUENCE OPENING MEMORY:\nopening_goal=先建立关系、同行状态、正常生活和情感资产，再让异常侵入。\nlarge_group_photo_rule=优先非正式广角自拍、定时、同行者随手拍或反射；允许不看镜头、裁切和正在动作中。\nSEQUENCE SHOT DIVERSITY:\nshot_diversity_rule=第一人称是摄影逻辑，不是固定的手+手机+远景模板。\navoid_same_shot_family_more_than_consecutive=2\nten_frame_distinct_shot_families_min=4\nrepeated_hand_phone_distant_anomaly_template_forbidden=true\nCAMERA DEFECT PHYSICS:\ndefects_must_have_physical_cause=true\nforbid_decorative_fake_damage=true\nforbid_every_night_frame_equally_blurred=true\nSEQUENCE VISUAL MEMORY:\ntime_of_day_must_progress_plausibly=true\ntime_reversal_requires_explicit_flashback_or_jump=true\nno_independent_beauty_time_selection_per_frame=true\npersist_continuity=character_appearance; wardrobe; vehicle; carried_props; route_and_location; weather; lighting_direction_when_same_scene; anomaly_evidence\nSEQUENCE SCREEN CONTENT PHYSICS:\nscreen_must_be_internally_consistent=true\nscreen_must_match_scene_when_story_critical=true\nscreen_reflection_and_orientation_must_be_physical=true\nforbid_fake_impossible_camera_ui=true\nsubject_visibility_rule=若核心主角必须出现在画面中，默认由同行者/现场另一人持机记录；仍禁止全知第三人称和导演式机位。\nselfie_rule=自拍不是默认。只有剧情/Frame Contract明确要求自拍时才使用自拍构图。\nvisual profile supplies texture/era/color/light; capture grammar supplies per-frame camera authorship, moment and camera physics; sequence grammar supplies multi-frame pacing and continuity\ndo not convert film/cinematic texture into staged movie-still blocking\ncapture_forbidden=omniscient_third_person_camera; director_blocking; staged_group_lineup; symmetrical_hero_framing; poster_composition; commercial_promo_composition; characters_arranged_for_camera; floating_camera_outside_human_position\n----- END GLOBAL CAPTURE GRAMMAR -----\ncapture physics and story era override decorative texture\ndo not silently substitute another visual profile or capture grammar\n</visual_contract>\n\n<frame_contract>\nRESOLVED FRAME CONTRACT | frame=09 | sha256=ca5a6538e8e33710047afc49678208ee8bd338d4d1aca19a81cf6757881fa78c\nThis derived contract is mandatory. Locked sources outrank ad-hoc prompt wording.\n\n[STORYBOARD FRAME]\n## 图 09｜路面第二层\n- 场景：井盖与车道线错位\n- Story Beat：reveal\n- 画面合同：十字路口，沥青最上层从井盖边缘卷起像极薄黑色皮，下面露出另一套更窄旧车道线、偏位井盖，以及暗灰骨板纹理的躯体表面；一辆普通轿车经过提供比例。路面之下不是地基，是“皮下的身体”。\n- 字幕草案：连路面都有一层。\n- 硬约束：真实手机相册感；第一人称；不摆拍；不增加专业角色；异常必须在像素中可读。\n\n[VISUAL DNA]\nprofi